{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1420.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"85837df900174df6fde7843abb3cf776e9808336bd83e244dc9873076b4235a9","ja":"あら、茜ちゃんも？\n私も昨日、朋花ちゃんに頼られたの。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1420.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"e993fc71ae074e6b5759d08fd6534309561850f2b5d0f09a4b890f29b71699e8","ja":"みなさんもですか？　最近の朋花さん、\nなんだか甘えんぼさんになったみたいですね？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1420.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"e94862866434c8a7b18e26d6aec9b01ba27f07cfa076463f40de62473f90c261","ja":"うんうん！　隣にぴたってくっついてきて、\n子猫みたいな感じ？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1420.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"6b8995b6371cde1f64c139a3f03b2b7d891deab05e9e0d375b87a1a8ec0a5704","ja":"……もしかして朋花ちゃん、\nこの前の星梨花ちゃんと同じ状況なんじゃないかしら？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1420.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"3629400844711092ae7a325a3c4d09eeb8038a9066080c4825cb9e283c5b16d1","ja":"ほら、星梨花ちゃん、自分が演じた役に入り込んで\n影響を受けちゃってたでしょ。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1420.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"15021dfae95be1c9ebc64bc67ce983ed47992d2f591768e996a78040154acd99","ja":"でも朋花ちゃんの役って、藍ちゃんでしょ？\nぜんぜん違うよね？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1420.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"523a32d9424c7cb40425fe162ddfe6bb9118338718a5443673d108de7d1e81f7","ja":"ええ。朋花ちゃんの場合は\n影響が逆に出てるって言うか……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1420.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"cc1903ac0ef9f4d934e7d68f01e66d3ab1f00c947f5b481e9920a1499d1a6c3d","ja":"みんなに強く当たる役だったから、\nその反動で甘えたくなってるんじゃないかしら？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1420.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"7718987c945bef52f3b4c2d15fb88ce07821c6f4aa62df487ff74fdd273febf0","ja":"なるほど……！　朋花さん、優しいですから、\nああいう役はつらかったんですね……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1420.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"8b78c77e84917e84262d709615c4cc8a51fd1cc1e646c53c00f5d21fc5779c50","ja":"それなら、優しい優しい茜ちゃんが、\nもっとも～っと、朋花ちゃんを甘えさせちゃわなきゃ！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1420.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"c314fa9c73af6756b44c37093535771fb87c45006b7d74317a30fe39b7e5ff93","ja":"そうね。みんなで朋花ちゃんの事、\n癒やしてあげましょう！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
